OL,3,GNEWSAPlea for fixes to 'difficult
OL,4,Aconfusing' junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plea has been issued for help to fix
OL,7,F"one of the most difficult and
OL,8,Fconfusing locations for pedestrians" in
OL,9,Fa town.
OL,11,FWestmorland and Furness Council wants
OL,12,Fto tackle "long-standing issues" for
OL,13,Fpeople walking from the Scaws area into
OL,14,FSandgate in Penrith and has asked users
OL,15,Fto take part in a five-week
OL,16,Fconsultation.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
