OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1791437178
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlea for fixes to 'difficult
OL,4,Aconfusing' junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council proposed to remove
OL,7,FSandgate's "complicated double
OL,8,Fmini-roundabout", which it said was a
OL,9,Fbarrier for pedestrians, confused
OL,10,Fmotorists and put people off trying to
OL,11,Fcross the road at the junction.
OL,13,FA public consultation runs from Monday,
OL,14,Fwhile the hope was to start
OL,15,Fconstruction work in autumn 2027 and
OL,16,Fcomplete it by spring 2028.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
